WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Hello, everybody, my name is Markiplier, and welcome to Vee is Calling.

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:08.340
Now this is a type of... not quite simulator game, but you're a person who's going

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:11.960
on a video date, and things aren't what they seem.

